==Battleground==
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*5 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 5~15 seconds<sup>150f~450f</sup>.
*5 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 150 seconds<sup>4,500f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Even without [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]], this stage is extremely easy as the Aliens aren't even at 100% strength magnification. Maawth is your only real issue, so bring units like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] to easily defeat it.

